# Zircuit historical RPC (zircuit1/l2-geth only — frozen snapshot, no sync)
#
# Serves blocks/receipts/logs from a restored Liquify l2-geth datadir. Does not run
# op-node; the chain head stays at the snapshot tip (pre-Conduit history).
#
# Setup:
#   1. ./configure.sh
#   2. Restore external Liquify lz4 snapshot into HOST_DATADIR (see README)
#   3. docker compose up -d
#
# Chain ID 48900.

### Images ###
L2_GETH_IMAGE=zircuit1/l2-geth:v1.132.6

### Host paths ###
HOST_DATADIR=$HOME/zircuit-historical-data

### Ports ###
RPC_BIND_ADDR=127.0.0.1
HTTP_PORT=11565
WS_PORT=11566

### RPC ###
GAS_CAP=600000000
# Optional fallback for data missing from the local snapshot
SEQUENCER_HTTP=https://mainnet.zircuit.com
